Placeholder so chezmoi creates ~/.local/libexec.

.chezmoiexternals/devpod.toml downloads the devpod binary here, deliberately
off PATH, because ~/.local/bin/devpod is the managed wrapper that fronts it.
An external cannot create its own parent directory — chezmoi only makes
directories it manages — so without this file the apply fails with
"stat /home/<user>/.local/libexec: no such file or directory".
